GROOT is a read-only log and context collector for Kubernetes. It
produces a timestamped tarball containing pod logs, events, resource
manifests, node details, and optional notify fan-out (Slack, Discord,
Teams, PagerDuty, generic webhooks, email). One command, no kubectl
binary at runtime - client-go end-to-end.

Usage:
  groot collect --config /usr/local/share/examples/groot/groot.yml

WWW: https://github.com/hrodrig/groot
